share — Share (grid 20, viewBox 0 0 20 20)

glyphs (bbox: minX minY maxX maxY, grid units; hole hints use bbox containment only)

nodes
  links (path)
  left (circle) pivot 5,10 animates scale
  top (circle) pivot 15,5 animates scale
  bottom (circle) pivot 15,15 animates scale

inputs: count (number), pulse (trigger)

timelines
  pulse: 0.4s once, reduced motion: end, events pulse-done
    writes left.scale, top.scale, bottom.scale

machine
  layer main (writes left.scale, top.scale, bottom.scale)
    *idle: pose {}
        pulse && mod(count, 5) == 0 → pulsing
        pulse → pulsing
     pulsing: play pulse, emit shared
        pulse && mod(count, 5) == 0 → pulsing
        pulse → pulsing
        @end → idle

listeners
  click → fire pulse, set count=(scope) => (expected === 'number' ? Number(evaluate(e, scope)) : evaluate(e, scope))
